      en: ["Population: approx. 800.", "Pottery workshops: 5.", "Basket weaving annual output: 10,000 pieces.", "Choiseul Bay length: 1 km (0.62 mi).", "Distance to Castries: 35 km (21.7 mi).", "Gros Piton visible from 5 km away."],
      es: ["Ciudad costera del suroeste de la isla", "Pueblo principal del distrito de Choiseul", "Centro de la artesanía local", "Fundada alrededor del año 1763", "Alberga el Choiseul Arts and Craft Center", "Cerca del pueblo hay petroglifos históricos"],
