      en: ["Vigie is at an elevation of 80 m.", "The airport was built in 1941 as a military airfield.", "The neighborhood has about 2,000 residents.", "Runway length is 1,830 m.", "Over 300,000 passengers are handled annually.", "Vigie is 2 km from the city center."],
