      hu: ["A Sir Arthur Lewis Főiskolának ad otthont", "A Kormányház helyszíne", "Egykor heves csaták helyszíne", "Megőrzött erődítményekkel rendelkezik"],
      ro: ["Găzduiește Colegiul Sir Arthur Lewis", "Locația Casei Guvernului", "Cândva locul unor bătălii aprige", "Dispune de fortificații conservate"],
      en: ["Home to the Sir Arthur Lewis Community College", "Site of the official Government House", "Scene of frequent battles between French and British", "Features well-preserved military fortifications"],
      es: ["Alberga el Sir Arthur Lewis College", "Ubicación de la Government House", "Antiguo escenario de feroces batallas", "Cuenta con fortificaciones preservadas"],
