      en: ["Location of Gablewoods Shopping Mall", "Primary commercial hub in the north", "Houses the island's largest cinema complex", "Major junction for northern transit"],
      es: ["Sede de Gablewoods Mall", "Principal centro comercial del norte", "Alberga el cine más grande de la isla", "Importante nudo de comunicaciones"],
      pt: ["Localização do Gablewoods Mall", "Principal centro comercial do norte", "Abriga o maior cinema da ilha", "Importante nó de transportes"],
