      hu: "Micoud Village a legnagyobb település a délkeleti parton. Kereskedelmi központként szolgál a kiterjedt mezőgazdasági körzet számára.",
      ro: "Micoud Village este cea mai mare așezare de pe coasta de sud-est. Servește ca centru comercial pentru districtul agricol extins.",
      en: "Micoud Village is the largest settlement on the southeastern coast. It serves as the commercial hub for the expansive agricultural district.",
