      en: "Babonneau Village is a lively community in the fertile northern highlands. It is known for its diverse agricultural produce and rich flora.",
      es: "Babonneau Village es una comunidad vibrante en las fértiles tierras altas del norte. Es conocida por sus productos agrícolas y su rica flora.",
